==Trivia==
*Draconian's Japanese name, "Mad Dragons?" (狂竜？), may be taken from "Mad Dragon Virus" or "Frenzy Dragon Virus" (狂竜症), the Japanese name of the [[wikia:monsterhunter:Frenzy Virus|Frenzy Virus]] in ''Monster Hunter 4''.

